      <definition>v.t. To seize, clutch, snatch; to scrape, rake; to include.</definition>
      <page>926</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠮᠣᠷᠠᠨ ᠠᠪᠬᠤ</unicode>
